<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LA RETAIL LIFTS YR HEADLINE SHR.</title>
<headline>LA RETAIL LIFTS YR HEADLINE SHR.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31, 1996 vs</p>
<p>year to December 31, 1995</p>
<p>		    (millions of rands unless stated)</p>
<p>    Headline shr (cts)	 183   vs   507 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		  1,456   vs   507 loss</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    9.61    vs   3.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    9.62    vs   3.17 loss</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    0.09    vs   1.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		   9.02    vs   33.09</p>
<p>Full name: LA Retail Stores Ltd </p>
<p>NOTE - The group said that the results only reflected two</p>
<p>months of trading by LA Retail Stores following the reverse</p>
<p>listing into the Ensign cash shell and the change of the</p>
<p>company's year end from December 31 to August 31. They were</p>
<p>therefore not comparable.</p>
<p>It said the listing had been well received by the market and</p>
<p>it was well positioned to grow its core business and achieve</p>
<p>earnings as outlined in the prospectus.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
